\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Recorded by Kamen Nedev.\
"\'abThe Last 900 metres up to Kilometer Zero\'bb. A week after the landmark site of the #15M movement, Madrid's Puerta del Sol, was evicted and blocked by the authorities, Madrid's citizens march, once again victoriously, into the square. By now, it is clear that this civil disobedience movement is unstoppable by any legal and licit means. The challenge of where to take things from here is up to us and up to us only. This was an audio-travelling take produced at the end of the demo, while the crowds were triumphantly re-entering the Puerta del Sol square."\
